website https://github.com/cl4cnam/funcSug
rosettaCode http://www.rosettacode.org/wiki/Category:FuncSug
description FuncSug is a simple alternative to event-driven programming and game loops. It features deterministic structured concurrency, waiting of a determinate event and automatic branch cancellation. 
fileExtensions fg
writtenIn javascript
tryItOnline https://cl4cnam.github.io/try_FuncSug
keywords and awaitBeep awaitBip branch break calljs def do else exitAfter exitWith false finished for if in js not onBreak or par parallel select seq sequence spawn true var while

